# model: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing.s_reviews_wall
#, []
msgid ""
"\"Engaging with this team was effortless from start to end. Their "
"proficiency and meticulous approach greatly enhanced our project. I couldn't"
" be happier with the final product!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Saradnja s ovim timom bila je jednostavna od početka do kraja. Njihova "
"stručnost i pažljiv pristup značajno su unaprijedili naš projekat. Ne mogu "
"biti sretniji s krajnjim proizvodom!\""

# model: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing.s_reviews_wall
#, []
msgid ""
"\"Exceptional service and great communication throughout the entire process."
" They went above and beyond to ensure our project was a complete success.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Izuzetna usluga i odlična komunikacija tokom cijelog procesa. Otišli su "
"iznad i izvan da osiguraju potpun uspjeh našeg projekta.\""

# model: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing.s_reviews_wall
#, []
msgid ""
"\"From the first meeting, it was clear we were in good hands. They took our "
"vision and turned it into something even better than we had imagined. Highly"
" recommend!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Od prvog sastanka bilo je jasno da smo u dobrim rukama. Uzeli su našu "
"viziju i pretvorili je u nešto čak i bolje nego što smo zamišljali. Izričito"
" preporučujem!\""

# model: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing.s_customer_quote
#, []
msgid ""
"\"This company transformed our business. Their solutions are innovative and "
"reliable\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ova kompanija je transformisala naš biznis. Njihova rješenja su inovativna"
" i pouzdana\""

# model: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing.s_reviews_wall
#, []
msgid ""
"\"Working with this team was smooth and efficient at every stage. Their "
"skills and commitment to quality had a major impact on our project. I am "
"thrilled with the final results!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Rad s ovim timom bio je gladak i efikasan u svakoj fazi. Njihove vještine "
"i posvećenost kvalitetu imale su veliki utjecaj na naš projekat. Oduševljen "
"sam krajnjim rezultatima!\""

